image-to-pixel-art-go
=====================

Provenance
----------

This library packages the core pixel-processing behavior demonstrated by the
browser tool at:

  https://www.uwarp.design/image-to-pixel-art

That tool's algorithm and palette helpers originated as a TypeScript port of
Pixel It; the TypeScript package is published separately. This repository is
the idiomatic Go form of that same core (pipeline order: pixelate → grayscale →
palette → max size).

Upstream algorithm
------------------

The pixelation / grayscale / palette matching algorithm is a port of:

  https://github.com/giventofly/pixelit
  Author: José Moreira
  License: MIT (see LICENSE)

TypeScript reference implementation:

  https://github.com/sherotree/image-to-pixel-art

Built-in named palettes (Vinik24, Sunset 8, NES, Endesga 16, ...) are included
for API parity with the reference tool UI.

